{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1218,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acfc36ab6640e6d95ba0f4ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传递梦想的圣诞老人\r\n没有任何极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93a9f1ebfd4b7f13261fdac239b8fb403cc15107f3921cdcbe8d1465ea40e183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade896abead6763cfcdc0b43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乖乖等着吧，\r\n我立刻把梦想送到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ea32069b5240ba6059d432e34efd98ffc9a0cca6dc3e2b58570a5ceda6e9a8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e962b934bd596ac31c1d9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是伏特加！一起去送礼物吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35262376327e93a6a0c832da4307ea8d5f25c72736123b065241f129be13913",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a8ffc4d3aaba54b93cf7b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52fc8ca2fdad80f82735337a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你还真是个奇怪的家伙呢。\r\n居然想要支持我什么的。\r\n…虽然我也不觉得讨厌就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3dc784600ce404de2c4d28e3f67a1bb0a1b2ca912d64c25f513e57fe91bd3c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f22353c569696d690534829c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c82872d8a468c7ad7b36546080de7121f477614ca965a9aed5b1ce585843d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97a1c57f074bdc38bc5a3565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c76249a685fb9f9750702a9bec77a0f48bf5677e31f292201a7e3458e4d45b92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2da7c504c28f7f358af208cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是要成为第一的赛马娘的。\r\n你也要好好地跟上我，\r\n成为最棒的训练员哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "489e5987fb0388ba9436b3d6846dd7637ace6ed05a49b576666f544ec27b0619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:948ce3bf109f5f6f69a4ac8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使这样，\r\n我还是稍微有些依赖你的哦…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc484339b54aaf4252dca4dfe7f0363888b9b802bee9439d7ea71d6ac3039694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050f86686d60dd73e692c8bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年也要以第一名为目标，\r\n所以就算是正月也不能懈怠哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a74eda433598aa572a91fa22fae6b17f39361760067e0939aa4cdb273f5867e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ca2cc69084249d10584cca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力？你想要的话我一会儿就给你。\r\n呵呵，你最豪华的回礼，\r\n我可是很期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5177019a9a19de484ebf3d1fa4a2ae04b0191c4d94bfffea6240174caffbee4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55190b2abf2b3a8f4725d28b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你。情人节巧克力。\r\n先、先说好了，这不过是义理巧克力而已！\r\n…嘛，只是稍微有些特别罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d246de1de8d1d44158a3434e80089b689c6db0de57e7a5948be26ff823229ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d1dd243b8d50d150285991",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你在纸条上写好了要许的愿望吗？\r\n我已经写完了哟。\r\n内容当然是“成为第一名”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3637afd1b0c620baa02ee652fbb284a76266bdcbc7a0758a18d0a58bcc0d1690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0b902d645eb9aaa45edaff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的万圣节，\r\n做什么点心好呢……\r\n你也想要？真拿你没办法啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "046f3e5927608723bc50332c2e7a75b64f14e199a67b239cb505902e402943d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081561a4ec26616e66bb5102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年圣诞节，妈妈都会送我花束。\r\n选择的花语也都很讲究。\r\n今年会是什么呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb7521efdd3e23a52708f003f4f398473672bcb01f3c6c0ff9c194b3f732d9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a83310ef82d6b9b7dad5c2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你也能收到圣诞礼物的话，\r\n会很开心的吧…？\r\n不、不是要给你准备的意思哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae7ccd77fb369adec0fcfe539f71bb4dd242dd02ab0ef88bc3f79ccca87fb04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f4aba77b499429f3bdd778",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理所当然！",
      "source_fingerprint": "657f4bf18314c7fbb83481a00ed708a3bb0ee30e74e5a0cf4eabd7dee76d0095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c75e832151acaf5c5535ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直以第一名为目标而努力的话，\r\n不知不觉间一年就过去了呢。\r\n明年的我也会朝着更高的目标努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1191c1b420e30a05f5c372fc5f397a35fb165f6d5efd7e2dd795327d32c72d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4774a405f823dd94d34785bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你的生日吧。\r\n平时蒙受你照顾，\r\n蛋糕什么的包在我身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fbe083d7759981176221f2125ef40889d3afc3a94764d0ca781b91d7cfee0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c016270554271d67d673e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……生日快乐！\r\n我、我都给你庆祝了，\r\n至少表现得更高兴一点吧！真是的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fee87ffe33577dae9bd72e26948858f23fd64181515796c9ea094701f6c3dbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28b465cfa1e947d3757812aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼…？我的生日，\r\n你记得很清楚嘛…？\r\n嘛，身为担当训练员，这也是理所当然的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6010d4fdce6c719bd58fd7c52aa5eb5e54444b9073b46eb99a1c2d087322f7e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33360fea3c2184a5415c59c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是过生日，你和大家也太过喧闹了吧……\r\n嘛，不过我也不讨厌这样就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "603cef67126770f434c7530324cc47c8fb871d7a3d2dc15a4d289866cb97b26e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b25bc8815b0ccbdd0045cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了吧。\r\n别忘了查看一下哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef38626b363197dc12f675134abc18dc056d28e3ed8fd4e49e470d5b044a210",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5982eb378872ffce951643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这不是有礼物送来了嘛！\r\n喂，让我也看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd24d406c2868f025cf86ce6c44333a50b1771e2e60093b490a24c6982be4d6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:111b676b51d8a583cc9fbec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了呢。\r\n可不能满足于此，下次也要继续努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b45398c6c6bfd07364a88266d236926a0df3e47f3d2a6a5855f28b36083702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1141d877854d0407149df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就要开始了哟。\r\n你已经准备好了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2077b75c49974537286c72492f50200175ceb9b93d276c8176bb1f798a260231",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159c2064bf7bcdf7cfafcbba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了哟！\r\n要以第一名为目标，奔跑下去才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e715bdd0ccb1e83bf8bbe3791737fb323d80938e7c81aa166df31b4ac1dec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2147f7157eb1ef6c8d278db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会，为什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf39c610f84029df96b5a053147a30f0aee18c1428189755015e3b804bdc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717a71e3b3b39028f95971c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提高了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e1f80568f1c4b950034325487d0d9bc28933b539de8ea10c9fec3d9366f54b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3d640a3fac8ce8deb2b04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢白色加蓝色的服装配色。\r\n能够兼顾整洁的形象跟可爱感，\r\n再搭配荷叶边，很完美吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc6c32bae8ba18105e53cb68be9854484f89ec0b887a8c260f7f59a7c0e59fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19b968e7a9b176e5f4ade6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论再怎么喜欢的衣服，\r\n都还是很快就得买新的来穿。\r\n成长实在让人又高兴又烦恼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48c3931df30c32ce944961716f4890e44efa76e4382efe9d94e47c99f2354d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6862bedb5b63524db4df18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我跟伏特加的品味一样，\r\n就可以互借衣服……不、还是不行！\r\n因为，总觉得……就是不想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18bee253d08f16f63c335736d192aed4168d363ca5ec5e8b558275e7ce8d5f61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63c6a8c92b6fcaaf609186",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也有这样的事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4365d6de912a5ba5ff8b3a87d677facdec7f9707bb13cb39c5df0d74afca63de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1522e71b8f7314dcdcd42a53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了！是我们赢了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8d173637445618f7df030a22c0dd2d04d290970fa30382ddda004e8645ef33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1ec3085b0de347336de51b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会，为什么……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf39c610f84029df96b5a053147a30f0aee18c1428189755015e3b804bdc152",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f6b0bf75c213ca3b38b84e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也有这样的事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4365d6de912a5ba5ff8b3a87d677facdec7f9707bb13cb39c5df0d74afca63de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b9ac2fd212cfea5fa3123d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62008c910ab5dbff1138b3dedad347b1126106d7c44ebd8e87ebbb370e41673e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6378bebfbad8ff2117dc47c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对要成为第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caaea7721b84585ce03f0d596f3759be19b08dea8cc15e9771866b5e4ee574ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fe7eb9a4bd30c604b8b2d5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然能一起比赛什么的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11057d5fdb746a6bc2e9a1651878d54c841c18d040d55a78e9c8e95df2118eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a36f81b947ad61e799f82e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子小姐，状态怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1bb138db8bf5ad73094b19ff2e9dd99d22fe4ab72ce9930ef647f09cfa421d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb58d9de1b3258137128cf4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a361abf3fb404325b4aa17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦，要训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd5e4f727f9cd9a17c0078d5829ee04438aab1f7275dadc832240f7602c91e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:379c68a9a7928a73744fdb74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然有着很厉害的历史啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5342626189ae8ca09cc54900131a105426aaf0fc9e385f5b4e697f008c98da3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb7e4002f2a1bce549d6ce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参加比赛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4904075f4a1722bb60be3ee7a8dc6973ac5a113ff28332e1368533ce91222f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c467a9adf8e225039d93a208",
